{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_wolf_rider","model_identifier":"goblin_wolf_rider","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_wolf_rider\n\nGoblin wolf rider (C4), 1.2 m = 43 u goblin made to sit on goblin_wolf.\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. A rider with a short feathered spear, leather shin wraps and a ragged hide hood. Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades). MOUNTED CLIPS (ride_idle, ride, attack_spear, charge, death) are authored in slot space: parent this model's root to goblin_wolf `slot_rider` (y = 35.5 on the wolf); y = 0 is the saddle seat, the pelvis sits on it and the thighs straddle the saddle flaps and the feet hang straight down the flanks at the wolf's elbows (soles ~11.5 u below the seat, wolf y ~24). The on-foot clips (idle, walk, run, flee, taunt, aggro, injured) stand on y = 0 as usual for a dismounted rider.\n\n- Cubes: 34 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..45.0, z -7.5..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- on foot: one box 16 x 42 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0; mounted: use the wolf box plus 30 u of height\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) (on foot) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) (on foot) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (on foot) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch (on foot) |\n| `ride` | 0.8 | loop | bouncing in the saddle, spear upright, left fist on the pommel (loop) |\n| `attack_spear` | 0.9 | once | key 0.4 s: overhand stab down and forward past the wolf's right shoulder (reach ~25 u) |\n| `charge` | 0.42 | loop | crouched low, spear levelled forward under the arm (loop) |\n| `death_foot` | 1.2 | hold | on-foot death (dismounted): topples forward, holds, rests on y = 0 |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | jolted back 0.25, slides off the wolf's LEFT side (clear of goblin_wolf, whose death rolls onto its right side), lands 0.85 s and holds lying on the ground at y = -35.5 in slot space (= the ground under a standing wolf). If the wolf dies too, unparent the rider at 0.6 s keeping its world transform |\n| `ride_idle` | 2.4 | loop | sitting still on a standing wolf (loop 2.4 s, use with goblin_wolf idle) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 32.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 149.3 u/s (4.20 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 62.7 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 164.3 u/s (4.62 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 62.4 u per cycle\n- `ride`: rides at goblin_wolf speed (loop 0.8 s; use with the wolf walk/run)\n- `charge`: loop 0.42 s, matches goblin_wolf charge\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_spear`: key 0.4 s: overhand stab down and forward past the wolf's right shoulder (reach ~25 u)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 45, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `spear` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 37 u short spear, grip at the origin, point along -Z (25 u ahead), butt 12 u behind\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- Variant texture: goblin_wolf_rider_pale.png.\n"},"description":"# goblin_wolf_rider\n\nGoblin wolf rider (C4), 1.2 m = 43 u goblin made to sit on goblin_wolf.\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. A rider with a short feathered spear, leather shin wraps and a ragged hide hood. Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades). MOUNTED CLIPS (ride_idle, ride, attack_spear, charge, death) are authored in slot space: parent this model's root to goblin_wolf `slot_rider` (y = 35.5 on the wolf); y = 0 is the saddle seat, the pelvis sits on it and the thighs straddle the saddle flaps and the feet hang straight down the flanks at the wolf's elbows (soles ~11.5 u below the seat, wolf y ~24). The on-foot clips (idle, walk, run, flee, taunt, aggro, injured) stand on y = 0 as usual for a dismounted rider.\n\n- Cubes: 34 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..45.0, z -7.5..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- on foot: one box 16 x 42 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0; mounted: use the wolf box plus 30 u of height\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) (on foot) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) (on foot) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (on foot) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch (on foot) |\n| `ride` | 0.8 | loop | bouncing in the saddle, spear upright, left fist on the pommel (loop) |\n| `attack_spear` | 0.9 | once | key 0.4 s: overhand stab down and forward past the wolf's right shoulder (reach ~25 u) |\n| `charge` | 0.42 | loop | crouched low, spear levelled forward under the arm (loop) |\n| `death_foot` | 1.2 | hold | on-foot death (dismounted): topples forward, holds, rests on y = 0 |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | jolted back 0.25, slides off the wolf's LEFT side (clear of goblin_wolf, whose death rolls onto its right side), lands 0.85 s and holds lying on the ground at y = -35.5 in slot space (= the ground under a standing wolf). If the wolf dies too, unparent the rider at 0.6 s keeping its world transform |\n| `ride_idle` | 2.4 | loop | sitting still on a standing wolf (loop 2.4 s, use with goblin_wolf idle) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 32.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 149.3 u/s (4.20 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 62.7 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 164.3 u/s (4.62 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 62.4 u per cycle\n- `ride`: rides at goblin_wolf speed (loop 0.8 s; use with the wolf walk/run)\n- `charge`: loop 0.42 s, matches goblin_wolf charge\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_spear`: key 0.4 s: overhand stab down and forward past the wolf's right shoulder (reach ~25 u)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 45, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `spear` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 37 u short spear, grip at the origin, point along -Z (25 u ahead), butt 12 u behind\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- Variant texture: goblin_wolf_rider_pale.png.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,18.0,-3.0],"to":[4.5,22.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,18.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[57,46,66.0,50.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[111,46,117.0,50.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[66,46,75.0,50.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[117,46,123.0,50.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[81,39,90.0,45.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[90,39,99.0,45.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8ac204ee-9103-5d88-a700-d21641a215a5"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,22.0,-3.5],"to":[5.5,34.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,22.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[2,0,13.0,12.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[24,0,31.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[13,0,24.0,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[31,0,38.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[90,30,101.0,37.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[101,30,112.0,37.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"afeee94d-f1d6-5864-a492-0c071307b514"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,34.0,-1.5],"to":[1.5,35.0,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[42,60,45.0,61.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[45,60,48.0,61.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[48,60,51.0,61.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[51,60,54.0,61.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[109,51,112.0,54.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[112,51,115.0,54.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"713f14c2-6d3b-5337-8ab2-f4d6f96c678b"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":fa